+# Incident: Cart Quantity Not Accumulating
+
+## Description
+Users are reporting that when they add an item to their shopping cart multiple times, the quantity of the item in the cart does not increase as expected. Instead, the quantity is being overwritten with the last added amount. This is leading to incorrect cart totals and a degraded shopping experience. We are observing discrepancies in cart item quantities and overall cart values.
\ No newline at end of file
